      "last_edit_date": 1415906288,
      "message_parsed": "Версия TorrentPier II: 2.1.3 [ALPHA]<br />\nДвижок без модов на демо-сервере.<br />\n<span style=\"font-size: 15px\">Версия PHP: 5.5.18-1</span><br />\n<br />\nПри загрузке торрента лезет ошибка:<br />\n<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">Deprecated: preg_replace(): The /e modifier is deprecated, use preg_replace_callback instead in /var/www/demo/data/www/***/library/attach_mod/posting_attachments.php on line 975</pre><br />\n975 строка posting_attachments.php:<br />\n<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">$this-&gt;attach_filename = preg_replace(&quot;/([\\xC2\\xC3])([\\x80-\\xBF])/e&quot;, &quot;chr(ord(&#039;\\\\1&#039;)&lt;&lt;6&amp;0xC0|ord(&#039;\\\\2&#039;)&amp;0x3F)&quot;, $this-&gt;attach_filename);</pre>",
      "message_state": "visible",
      "position": 0,
      "post_date": 1415906127,
      "user_id": 79,
      "user_title": "User",
      "username": "Lynx"
    },
    {
      "attach_count": 0,
      "attachments": [],
      "id": 67051,
      "is_admin": true,
      "is_moderator": true,
      "is_staff": true,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "Закомментируйте или удалите строку. Версия php &gt; 5.4 такое вызывает. Ничего критичного в строке особенно нет, замена будет.",
      "message_state": "visible",
      "position": 1,
      "post_date": 1415907518,
      "user_id": 1,
      "user_title": "Administrator",
      "username": "Exile"
    },
    {
      "attach_count": 0,
      "attachments": [],
      "id": 67055,
      "is_admin": false,
      "is_moderator": false,
      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "Можно заменить на это.<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">$this-&gt;attach_filename = preg_replace(&#039;#([\\xC2\\xC3])([\\x80-\\xBF])#&#039;, &#039;chr(ord(\\&#039;$1\\&#039;)&lt;&lt;6&amp;0xC0|ord(\\&#039;$2\\&#039;)&amp;0x3F)&#039;, $this-&gt;attach_filename);</pre>",
